                            "On October 30, 2026, shares slid roughly 5% post-earnings as analysts debated cycle-peak risk; Morningstar raised 2027–2028 profit forecasts on HBM4 pricing but kept a \u0027None\u0027 moat rating citing cyclicality and Chinese rivals CXMT and YMTC.",
                            "On November 17, 2026, TrendForce highlighted a Bank of America report showing NAND spot prices dropped roughly 20% in two weeks on weak PC/smartphone demand and YMTC competition, weighing on Samsung and SK hynix shares.",
