                            "On November 20, 2026, Samsung promoted HBM/DRAM chief Sang Joon Hwang to President and Head of Memory while naming Won-Joon Choi to lead Mobile, freeing Vice Chairman Young Hyun Jun to focus on broader DS and foundry growth."
